      "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_ghost_convo02_01.mp3",
      "text": "You look nervous Lady Geist.",
      "duration": 2.85
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "character": "Lady geist",
      "audioFile": "ghost_match_start_haze_ghost_convo02_02",
      "audioUrl": "audio/ghost_match_start_haze_ghost_convo02_02.mp3",
      "text": "As a general rule I do my best to avoid state sponsored assassins.",
      "duration": 4.206
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "character": "Haze",
      "audioFile": "haze_match_start_haze_ghost_convo02_03",
      "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_ghost_convo02_03.mp3",
      "text": "Assassins work in the private sector. When you're federally employeed you're called an asset.",
      "duration": 5.65
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "character": "Lady geist",
      "audioFile": "ghost_match_start_haze_ghost_convo02_04",
      "audioUrl": "audio/ghost_match_start_haze_ghost_convo02_04.mp3",
      "text": "Apologies, forgive the wrong nomenclature.",
      "duration": 3.491
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "character": "Haze",
      "audioFile": "haze_match_start_haze_ghost_convo02_05",
      "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_ghost_convo02_05.mp3",
      "text": "Happens all the time.",
      "duration": 2.138
    }
  ]
